{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"lvzang-e-o077","title":"评吕布虓虎之勇无英奇之略陈登臧洪雄气壮节","accounts":[{"id":"lvzang-a-6b0096a4aeb89cc3ebb4","label":"正文","text":"评吕布虓虎之勇无英奇之略陈登臧洪雄气壮节","evidence":["lvzang-q-3d10b611ffc7052ddc5a"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lvzang-q-3d10b611ffc7052ddc5a"]},"ordering_evidence":"lvzang-q-3d10b611ffc7052ddc5a","source_order":[7,352,0],"order":1907}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"lvzang-q-3d10b611ffc7052ddc5a","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-6b753cdef1b6356c5658","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：吕布有虓虎之勇〖1〗，而无英奇之略；轻狡反覆，唯利是视〖2〗：自古及今，未有若此不夷灭也。昔汉光武谬于庞萌〖3〗，近魏太祖亦蔽于张邈〖4〗。“知人则哲”，“唯帝难之”，信矣！陈登、臧洪，并有雄气壮节：登降年夙陨〖5〗，功业未遂；洪以兵弱敌强，烈志不立。惜哉","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":131}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
